        "answer": {
          "text": "Hi Mia, thank you for the invitation. It's a great idea, and I can see why you like it. Honestly, I'm a bit worried about this month. I have exams, and my time is very tight. I'm afraid I can't say yes to a film club every Friday, because I wouldn't be a good host. Perhaps it would be better to wait until the exams are over. How about a film evening once a month instead? We could watch a film at your place next Saturday and then decide together. I'd rather do something small for now. I hope you understand! See you soon, Ana",
          "accepted": [
            "Hi Mia, thank you for the invitation. It's a great idea, and I can see why you like it. Honestly, I'm a bit worried about this month. I have exams, and my time is very tight. I'm afraid I can't say yes to a film club every Friday, because I wouldn't be a good host. Perhaps it would be better to wait until the exams are over. How about a film evening once a month instead? We could watch a film at your place next Saturday and then decide together. I'd rather do something small for now. I hope you understand! See you soon, Ana",
            "Hello Mia, thanks for thinking of me. A film club is a nice idea. To be honest, I'm a little tired this month, and the exams are very close. I'm afraid I can't join every Friday, because I need that time to study. Maybe we could start in June, when my exams are finished. What if we watch one film together this Saturday instead? I would bring the snacks and you could choose the film. It would be fun, and we could decide about the club later. I'd rather be honest than say yes and cancel. Speak soon, Ana"
          ]
        },
